# The source project for the generated pages lives at ./portfolio-site. Its *source* is
# tracked here on purpose — that is the whole point of it being in this repo — but its
# dependencies and its build directories are not.
#
# What IS committed is the build OUTPUT, up at the repo root: demos/, products/ and
# _next/. GitHub Pages serves this repo as-is, so those have to be in git.
#
# demo/ at the root is committed too but is NOT build output — it is the demo photography
# itself, read in place at build time. It deliberately does not live in
# portfolio-site/public/, which would make the export copy every photo into out/ and then
# back up here, tracking all of them twice.
portfolio-site/node_modules/
portfolio-site/.next/
portfolio-site/out/
portfolio-site/next-env.d.ts
portfolio-site/*.tsbuildinfo

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
